# Software industry mapping for GRC
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/grc/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:security_control owl:equivalentClass sw:SecurityControl .
legacy:security_control_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:securityControlId .
legacy:soc_evidence owl:equivalentClass sw:SocEvidence .
legacy:soc_evidence_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:socEvidenceId .
legacy:evidences_security_control rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:evidencesSecurityControl .
